# Ignore generated game data, EXCEPT the hand-authored tooling config files
# (slot-name strip/exclude patterns + the community-requests feed — not game
# content; the bake + viewer need them). `site/data/*` (not `site/data/`) so the
# `!` re-includes can take effect.
site/data/*
!site/data/strip_patterns.json
!site/data/slot_excludes.json
!site/data/community_requests.json

# Cached third-party runtime — fetch from Esoteric on setup (see README)
spine-player.js
spine-player.css
**/spine-player.js
**/spine-player.css
render/illust/_spine43_patched.js

# Community datasets — fetch your own (see README / CREDITS.md)
